	(text_box "Serial debugging is performed using a USB-to-TTL module. The MCU's programming pins are shared with the serial debugging pins; this should be taken into account during programming and debugging. Pin P2 is not used by the TTL module; do not connect it. It serves as a debug pin-for an LED, for example. "
